     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Search Field facilitates fast information retrieval from a large dataset. It empowers users who have a clear understanding of what they are looking for and can provide appropriate search terms. However, it is important to note that Search Field is not suitable for browsing or discovering previously unknown content. It is not intended to serve as the primary means of navigation on a page or site, but should only provide a complementary mechanism to for example Top Navigation and Links.",
